{
  "category": "Hermit Crab Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "The SHELLDER that is latched onto SLOWPOKE's tail is said to feed on the host's left over scraps.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "The SHELLDER that is latched onto SLOWPOKE's tail is said to feed on the host's left over scraps.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lives lazily by the sea. If the SHELLDER on its tail comes off, it becomes a SLOWPOKE again.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "If the tail-biting SHELLDER is thrown off in a harsh battle, it reverts to being an ordinary SLOWPOKE.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Naturally dull to begin with, it lost its ability to feel pain due to SHELLDER's seeping poison.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "An attached SHELLDER won't let go because of the tasty flavor that oozes out of its tail.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "SLOWBRO’s tail has a SHELLDER firmly attached with a bite. As a result, the tail can’t be used for fishing anymore. This causes SLOWBRO to grudgingly swim and catch prey instead.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "SLOWBRO’s tail has a SHELLDER firmly attached with a bite. As a result, the tail can’t be used for fishing anymore. This causes SLOWBRO to grudgingly swim and catch prey instead.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its tail has a SHELLDER firmly attached with a bite. As a result, the tail can’t be used for fishing anymore. This forces it to reluctantly swim and catch prey.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "When a SLOWPOKE went hunting in the sea, its tail was bitten by a SHELLDER. That made it evolve into SLOWBRO.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "The SHELLDER that latches onto SLOWPOKE’s tail is said to feed on the host’s leftover scraps.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the SHELLDER on its tail bites down.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the SHELLDER on its tail bites down.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the SHELLDER on its tail bites down.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "If the tail-biting SHELLDER is thrown off in a harsh battle, it reverts to being an ordinary SLOWPOKE.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Naturally dull to begin with, it lost its ability to feel pain due to SHELLDER’s seeping poison.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
    },
    {
      "text": "Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the Shellder on its tail bites down.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the Shellder on its tail bites down.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the Shellder on its tail bites down.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the Shellder on its tail bites down.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "An attached Shellder won’t let go because of the tasty flavor that oozes out of its tail.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "When a Slowpoke went hunting in the sea, its tail was bitten by a Shellder. That made it evolve into Slowbro.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slowbro’s tail has a Shellder firmly attached with a bite. As a result, the tail can’t be used for fishing anymore. This causes Slowbro to grudgingly swim and catch prey instead.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slowbro’s tail has a Shellder firmly attached with a bite. As a result, the tail can’t be used for fishing anymore. This causes Slowbro to grudgingly swim and catch prey instead.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It spaces out while gazing at the sea. With Shellder’s poison flowing through its body, it becomes even spacier.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whenever Shellder bites down hard on its tail, it gives Slowbro a flash of inspiration...which it forgets a moment later.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spacing out is basically all it does. It turns back into Slowpoke if its tail, along with Shellder, breaks off.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shellder, in its greed to suck out more and more sweetness from Slowbro’s tail, has metamorphosed into a spiral-shaped shell.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lives lazily by the sea. If the Shellder on its tail comes off, it becomes a Slowpoke again.",
      "version": "lets-go-pikachu"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lives lazily by the sea. If the Shellder on its tail comes off, it becomes a Slowpoke again.",
      "version": "lets-go-eevee"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slowpoke became Slowbro when a Shellder bit on to its tail. Sweet flavors seeping from the tail make the Shellder feel as if its life is a dream.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Being bitten by a Shellder shocked this Pokémon into standing on two legs. If the Shellder lets go, it seems Slowbro will turn back into a Slowpoke.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
